There is AC here.
I like this cold very much.
Inside the café, it is very peaceful.
There is no noise here.
There are not many people in the café.
A song can be heard very softly.
I look around the café.
I need a good table.
Many tables are empty here.
I see a table near the window.
It is at the front of the café.
That table is in a corner.
I walk towards that table.
I put my bag on the chair.
After that, I sit down there.
This chair is very comfortable.
I happily look outside through the window.
